    "detailed_description": "<strong><u>ABOUT THIS GAME</u></strong><br>Run your way as far as you can in RampageRunners. Where you dodge and smash through obstacles in chase of the highest score. The game features a auto-runner game mechanic. Where you move left and right to dodge obstacles, or dash to smash right through them! If you play well enough you will meet the final boss in a final battle and earn many bonus points.<br><br><br><strong><u>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</u></strong><br>I\u2019m a solo developer starting to learn how to create games and releasing them on steam. With time I hope to create better games. But for now perhaps just one other person can have some fun with my games while I continue my journey. The game is completely free!",
